{"blocks":[["Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Vocoder/","source-block-328","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Wave → Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Vocoder/Wave",["Vocoder Oscillator (Vocoder)","Parameters"]],["Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Vocoder/","source-block-427","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Timbre → Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Vocoder/Timbre",["Vocoder Oscillator (Vocoder)","Parameters"]],["Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Vocoder/","source-block-530","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Shape → Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Vocoder/Shape",["Vocoder Oscillator (Vocoder)","Parameters"]],["Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Vocoder/","source-block-631","Source",["Vocoder Oscillator (Vocoder)"]],["Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Vocoder/","source-block-644","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/22 Vocoder",["Vocoder Oscillator (Vocoder)","Source"]],["Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Vocoder/Shape/","source-block-120","Shape (Vocoder)",[]],["Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Vocoder/Shape/","source-block-140","Set by the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Shape while the oscillator model is Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Vocoder.",["Shape (Vocoder)"]],["Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Vocoder/Shape/","source-block-272","Sets the bandwidth of the individual bandpass filters. Higher settings narrow the frequency response, emphasizing more pronounced harmonics.",["Shape (Vocoder)"]],["Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Vocoder/Shape/","source-block-416","Source",["Shape (Vocoder)"]],["Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Vocoder/Shape/","source-block-429","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/22 Vocoder",["Shape (Vocoder)","Source"]],["Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Vocoder/Timbre/","source-block-120","Timbre (Vocoder)",[]],["Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Vocoder/Timbre/","source-block-141","Set by the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Timbre while the oscillator model is Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Vocoder.",["Timbre (Vocoder)"]],["Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Vocoder/Timbre/","source-block-274","Changes the frequency range used for analysis and resynthesis. Voice formants are frequency peaks; for example, a “U” often has peaks near 330 Hz and 1260 Hz, with variation across speakers and cultures. The synthesis filters recreate the input loudness contour in the selected range. Narrowing the range reduces the frequencies the Vocoder monitors, improving response time and frequency output.",["Timbre (Vocoder)"]],["Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Vocoder/Timbre/","source-block-678","Source",["Timbre (Vocoder)"]],["Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Vocoder/Timbre/","source-block-691","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/22 Vocoder",["Timbre (Vocoder)","Source"]],["Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Vocoder/Wave/","source-block-120","Wave (Vocoder)",[]],["Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Vocoder/Wave/","source-block-139","Set by the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Wave while the oscillator model is Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Vocoder.",["Wave (Vocoder)"]],["Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Vocoder/Wave/","source-block-270","At 0%, it produces a sawtooth. Around 11%, it becomes a pulse wave with a 50% duty cycle. From there the pulse width increases clockwise until it reaches a 99% duty cycle at 90%. From 91% to 100%, it produces noise.",["Wave (Vocoder)"]],["Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Vocoder/Wave/","source-block-489","Source",["Wave (Vocoder)"]],["Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Vocoder/Wave/","source-block-502","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/22 Vocoder",["Wave (Vocoder)","Source"]],["Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Waveshaper/","source-block-222","Waveshaping Oscillator (Waveshaper)",[]],["Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Waveshaper/","source-block-262","Oscillator model 7 of 22 on the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type, shown on the display as Waveshaper.",["Waveshaping Oscillator (Waveshaper)"]],["Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Waveshaper/","source-block-373",